          "text": "ak ghoang'waay ak ghabwar aba ng'uta ea sugoocheandaanyi, ea mujiinajeagaaschi, ea siida was sean mida jeedida, manda dea abit earagi, gawuurji gidasin aba Egloni, ak ghwanung' goosha sean gili was sih mida jeeda.",
