          "text": "ak ghoang'waay sugoocheandaanyi ea mujiinajeagaaschi sean, ak geabwar aba ng'uta ak ghwanung' goosha fuga sean mida jeedida ak ea moabuuda eara agi gawuurji gidaghayi hinda Hebroni ea ghoah Libina ea sugoocheandaanyi, ea Debiri ea sugoocheandaanyi.",
