              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwajoar Yoshuwa ng'eanyiisean bea ng'eanyiida heayeeniga ea Negebu, ea moohajeega, ea heayeeniga giijeega, ea sugoodigaaschi sean; ak ea moabuuda eara siyagi ghwanung' goosha sean gea gisa jeameeda gawuurji gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
