              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwaraada Yoshuwa saawa nea ghoang'eada Gadesh-barneya ea ghwahita Gaasa ea ng'eanyiisean bea Gosheni ea ghoah Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
