              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoang'waay Yoshuwa sugoodisu seaniin ea ng'eanyiida nyaawa sean aba damandida aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, gang'uchi aba badayda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
